[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 15961.83, "timestamp": "04:26:01", "text": "评分就足够了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15968.87, "timestamp": "04:26:08", "text": "如果我完成了所有这些，包括两年制"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15983.67, "timestamp": "04:26:23", "text": "到那时我就30岁左右了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15986.469, "timestamp": "04:26:26", "text": "什么鬼？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15989.349, "timestamp": "04:26:29", "text": "我会老的。Dio 只是为了……不，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15991.99, "timestamp": "04:26:31", "text": "实际上对每个人来说都是如此，很多人都……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15994.55, "timestamp": "04:26:34", "text": "很多新一批的……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15997.349, "timestamp": "04:26:37", "text": "除了一个人，其他都是音乐专业的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15999.67, "timestamp": "04:26:39", "text": "因为他直接找到了工作。他们直接去"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16001.83, "timestamp": "04:26:41", "text": "应聘，拿到了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16006.229, "timestamp": "04:26:46", "text": "工作邀请。除了其他人，其他人都找到了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16008.71, "timestamp": "04:26:48", "text": "呃，你是说我到那儿的时候就30岁了？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16010.79, "timestamp": "04:26:50", "text": "什么？对我来说呢？是啊，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16014.07, "timestamp": "04:26:54", "text": "我完成所有事情的时候就30岁了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16017.189, "timestamp": "04:26:57", "text": "两年的语言课程，四年的"}]